fix(tts): retry with built-in voice on 400, swallow autoplay errors silently

- ElevenLabs TTS endpoint now retries with built-in Rachel voice
  (21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM) when the configured ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID
  returns 400 (invalid voice for the API key)
- Auto-play greeting on page load now swallows TTS errors so the UI
  never shows a startup error banner if autoplay is blocked or
  ElevenLabs key is missing
